{"protocol":"mindblown-brain/1","brain":"projects","page":{"id":"projects/ledgerline-mobile","title":"Ledgerline Mobile","type":"project","lobe":"ledger","parent":null,"desc":"Sanitized phone apps, independent review and gated integration.","intro":"Sanitized phone apps, independent review and gated integration.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-13","synapses":["projects/ledgerline-mobile#1","projects/ledgerline-mobile#2","projects/ledgerline-mobile#3","projects/ledgerline-mobile#4","projects/ledgerline-mobile#5","projects/ledgerline-mobile#6","projects/ledgerline-mobile#7","projects/ledgerline-mobile#8","projects/ledgerline-mobile#9"],"sources":["pplx://sessions/72485191-245e-a262-2012-22d654504ace","pplx://sessions/1f6f40af-477e-0165-ee99-ebbfb4646619","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/ledgerline/pull/24","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/ledgerline/pull/22"],"sections":["How it works","See also"]},"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Fledgerline-mobile","parent":null,"children":[],"synapses":[{"id":"projects/ledgerline-mobile#1","page":"projects/ledgerline-mobile","lead":"Audit note is not acceptance","text":"the audit note retains per statement, but this does not establish tracking entry acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/1f6f40af-477e-0165-ee99-ebbfb4646619"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-mobile#2","page":"projects/ledgerline-mobile","lead":"Honest audit note limits","text":"audit note changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check in the private register is bounded evidence, not proof that the page image works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/72485191-245e-a262-2012-22d654504ace","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/ledgerline/pull/22"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-mobile#3","page":"projects/ledgerline-mobile","lead":"Weekly CSV survives rollback","text":"the weekly CSV retains per tax year and surfaces a plain warning when the audit note is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/72485191-245e-a262-2012-22d654504ace"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-mobile#4","page":"projects/ledgerline-mobile","lead":"No silent register row changes","text":"Sam chose to keep the register row and the weekly CSV distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/ledgerline/pull/22"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-mobile#5","page":"projects/ledgerline-mobile","lead":"Bounded year report evidence","text":"Sam chose to keep the year report and the weekly CSV distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/72485191-245e-a262-2012-22d654504ace"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-mobile#6","page":"projects/ledgerline-mobile","lead":"Duplicate guard survives rollback","text":"the audit note is derived from the duplicate guard on the hosted copy; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/ledgerline-managed-register"],"cites":["pplx://sessions/1f6f40af-477e-0165-ee99-ebbfb4646619"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-mobile#7","page":"projects/ledgerline-mobile","lead":"Default-off audit note","text":"the audit note exports on the hosted copy and surfaces a plain warning when the year report is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/ledgerline-email-receipts"],"cites":["pplx://sessions/1f6f40af-477e-0165-ee99-ebbfb4646619"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-mobile#8","page":"projects/ledgerline-mobile","lead":"Weekly CSV is not acceptance","text":"Sam chose to keep the weekly CSV and the year report distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/1f6f40af-477e-0165-ee99-ebbfb4646619"]},{"id":"projects/ledgerline-mobile#9","page":"projects/ledgerline-mobile","lead":"Reusable audit note","text":"the category rule is derived from the audit note on the hosted copy; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/72485191-245e-a262-2012-22d654504ace","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/ledgerline/pull/24"]}],"sources":[{"id":"pplx://sessions/72485191-245e-a262-2012-22d654504ace","label":"72485191","kind":"session","pages":["projects/kinetic-type-experiments","projects/holiday-playlist-for-nan","projects/desk-synth-build","projects/ledgerline","projects/ledgerline-managed-register","projects/ledgerline-mobile"]},{"id":"pplx://sessions/1f6f40af-477e-0165-ee99-ebbfb4646619","label":"1f6f40af","kind":"session","pages":["projects/hollow-pines-radio","projects/hollow-pines-performance","projects/ledgerline-managed-register","projects/ledgerline-reports","projects/ledgerline-mobile"]},{"id":"https://git.example.test/sam-vale/ledgerline/pull/24","label":"sam-vale/ledgerline #24","kind":"github","pages":["projects/ledgerline-document-upload","projects/ledgerline-mobile"]},{"id":"https://git.example.test/sam-vale/ledgerline/pull/22","label":"sam-vale/ledgerline #22","kind":"github","pages":["projects/ledgerline-mobile"]}],"neighbours":{"out":[{"page":"projects/orbit-kitchen-recipe-import","w":1,"kinds":["mention"],"notes":[]},{"page":"projects/ledgerline-reports","w":2,"kinds":["see-also"],"notes":["public demo"]}],"in":[{"page":"projects/ledgerline","w":5,"kinds":["mention","see-also"],"notes":["shared host","shared host"]},{"page":"projects/ledgerline-document-upload","w":3,"kinds":["mention","see-also"],"notes":["print partner"]},{"page":"projects/ledgerline-managed-